982	    /**
983	     * Composes the stored/returned {@code address} from the normalized structured lines: the
984	     * normalized {@code addressLine1}, with a single space and the normalized {@code addressLine2}
985	     * appended when {@code addressLine2} is present (non-empty). Both arguments are already
986	     * normalized via {@link #normalizeAddress(String)}.
987	     *
