     * {@code 'PREMIUM_METRO'}, {@code 'PREMIUM_REGIONAL'}, {@code 'STANDARD_METRO'} or
     * {@code 'STANDARD_REGIONAL'}. TIER is {@code 'PREMIUM'} when the owner's {@code membershipLevel}
